      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of spontaneous coronary artery dissection, an extremely rare condition, is reported in a thirty-two-year-old woman. The pathological and clinical features as well as the management of this condition are discussed. Recent postulates with regard to aetiology and pathogenesis are emphasized."},
